       AND (NOT `s 88B the company has given a notice under section 88B (change of registered email address) that is awaiting registration by the registrar`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This section applies where— (a) a company makes a confirmation statement, (b) the company’s registered email address is not an appropriate email address within the meaning given by section 88A(2), and (c) the company has not given a notice under section 88B ... that is awaiting registration by the registrar."

