        IF `there has been no change in any of the matters required to be dealt with by the statement of capital since the last such statement was delivered to the registrar` THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply if there has been no change in any of the matters required to be dealt with by the statement of capital since the last such statement was delivered to the registrar."
        IF `s 853D(1) this section applies` EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
