    `s 853D(4)(d)(iii) the statement gives the aggregate nominal value of shares of that class` IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:11482 | (4) The statement of capital must state with respect to the company's share capital at the confirmation date—
-- src:11483 | (a) the total number of shares of the company,
-- src:11484 | (b) the aggregate nominal value of those shares,
-- src:11485 | (c) the aggregate amount (if any) unpaid on those shares (whether on account of their nominal value or by way of premium), and
-- src:11486 | (d) for each class of shares—
-- src:11487 | (i) prescribed particulars of the rights attached to the shares,
-- src:11488 | (ii) the total number of shares of that class, and
-- src:11489 | (iii) the aggregate nominal value of shares of that class.
@ref s 853D(4) Duty to deliver statement of capital (src:11482-11489)
GIVEN `the statement states the total number of shares of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the statement states the aggregate nominal value of those shares` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the statement states the aggregate amount (if any) unpaid on those shares (whether on account of their nominal value or by way of premium)` IS A BOOLEAN
      classes IS A LIST OF `s 853D(4)(d) statement about a class of shares`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 853D(4) the statement of capital states what the subsection requires with respect to the company's share capital at the confirmation date` MEANS
    IF     `the statement states the total number of shares of the company`
       AND `the statement states the aggregate nominal value of those shares`
       AND `the statement states the aggregate amount (if any) unpaid on those shares (whether on account of their nominal value or by way of premium)`
       AND all (GIVEN c YIELD c's `s 853D(4)(d)(i) the statement gives prescribed particulars of the rights attached to the shares` AND c's `s 853D(4)(d)(ii) the statement gives the total number of shares of that class` AND c's `s 853D(4)(d)(iii) the statement gives the aggregate nominal value of shares of that class`) classes
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The statement of capital must state with respect to the company's share capital at the confirmation date— (a) the total number of shares of the company, (b) the aggregate nominal value of those shares, (c) the aggregate amount (if any) unpaid on those shares ..., and (d) for each class of shares— (i) prescribed particulars of the rights attached to the shares, (ii) the total number of shares of that class, and (iii) the aggregate nominal value of shares of that class."

§§ `s 853E Duty to notify trading status of shares`

-- src:11491 | (1) This section applies where a company having a share capital makes a confirmation statement.
@ref s 853E(1) Duty to notify trading status of shares (src:11491-11491)
GIVEN `the company has a share capital` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company makes a confirmation statement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 853E(1) this section applies` MEANS
    IF `the company has a share capital` AND `the company makes a confirmation statement`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This section applies where a company having a share capital makes a confirmation statement."

-- src:11500 | (6) In this Part—
-- src:11501 | “DTR5 issuer” means an issuer to which Chapter 5 of the Disclosure Rules and Transparency Rules sourcebook made by the Financial Conduct Authority (as amended or replaced from time to time) applies;
-- src:11502 | “relevant market” means—
-- src:11503 | (a) a recognised investment exchange, as defined in section 285(1)(a) (exemption for recognised exemption exchanges and clearance houses) of the Financial Services and Markets Act 2000 (“the Act”); and
-- src:11504 | (b) any other market which is a UK regulated market or an EU regulated market,
-- src:11505 | but not an overseas investment exchange, as defined by section 313 (interpretation of Part 18) of the Act.
@ref s 853E(6) Duty to notify trading status of shares (src:11500-11505)
GIVEN `Chapter 5 of the Disclosure Rules and Transparency Rules sourcebook made by the Financial Conduct Authority (as amended or replaced from time to time) applies to the issuer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 853E(6) the issuer is a DTR5 issuer` MEANS
    IF `Chapter 5 of the Disclosure Rules and Transparency Rules sourcebook made by the Financial Conduct Authority (as amended or replaced from time to time) applies to the issuer`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“DTR5 issuer” means an issuer to which Chapter 5 of the Disclosure Rules and Transparency Rules sourcebook made by the Financial Conduct Authority (as amended or replaced from time to time) applies"

@ref s 853E(6) Duty to notify trading status of shares (src:11502-11505)
GIVEN `the market is a recognised investment exchange, as defined in section 285(1)(a) of the Financial Services and Markets Act 2000` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market is a UK regulated market or an EU regulated market` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the market is an overseas investment exchange, as defined by section 313 of that Act` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 853E(6) the market is a relevant market` MEANS
    IF (`the market is a recognised investment exchange, as defined in section 285(1)(a) of the Financial Services and Markets Act 2000` OR `the market is a UK regulated market or an EU regulated market`) AND (NOT `the market is an overseas investment exchange, as defined by section 313 of that Act`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“relevant market” means— (a) a recognised investment exchange ..., and (b) any other market which is a UK regulated market or an EU regulated market, but not an overseas investment exchange"

-- src:11497 | (5) The conditions are that—
-- src:11498 | (a) there were shares of the company which were shares admitted to trading on a relevant market;
-- src:11499 | (b) the company was a DTR5 issuer.
@ref s 853E(5) Duty to notify trading status of shares (src:11497-11499)
GIVEN `there were shares of the company which were shares admitted to trading on a relevant market` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company was a DTR5 issuer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 853E(5) both conditions were satisfied throughout the confirmation period concerned` MEANS
    IF `there were shares of the company which were shares admitted to trading on a relevant market` AND `the company was a DTR5 issuer`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The conditions are that— (a) there were shares of the company which were shares admitted to trading on a relevant market; (b) the company was a DTR5 issuer."

DECLARE `s 853E(4) trading status` IS ONE OF
    `s 853E(4)(a) no shares were admitted to trading on a relevant market or on any other market outside the United Kingdom`
    `s 853E(4)(b) shares were so admitted and both of the conditions in subsection (5) were satisfied throughout the confirmation period`
    `s 853E(4)(b) shares were so admitted and both of the conditions in subsection (5) were not satisfied throughout the confirmation period`

-- src:11494 | (4) The matters are—
-- src:11495 | (a) whether any of the company's shares were, at any time during the confirmation period concerned, shares admitted to trading on a relevant market or on any other market which is outside the United Kingdom, and
-- src:11496 | (b) if so, whether both of the conditions mentioned in subsection (5) were satisfied throughout the confirmation period concerned.
@ref s 853E(4) Duty to notify trading status of shares (src:11494-11496)
GIVEN `any of the company's shares were, at any time during the confirmation period concerned, shares admitted to trading on a relevant market or on any other market which is outside the United Kingdom` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 853E(5) both conditions were satisfied throughout the confirmation period concerned` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 853E(4) trading status`
`s 853E(4) the matters the statement must deal with` MEANS
    IF `any of the company's shares were, at any time during the confirmation period concerned, shares admitted to trading on a relevant market or on any other market which is outside the United Kingdom`
    THEN CONSIDER `s 853E(5) both conditions were satisfied throughout the confirmation period concerned`
         WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST `s 853E(4)(b) shares were so admitted and both of the conditions in subsection (5) were satisfied throughout the confirmation period`
         WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST `s 853E(4)(b) shares were so admitted and both of the conditions in subsection (5) were not satisfied throughout the confirmation period`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the conditions were satisfied is not known
    ELSE JUST `s 853E(4)(a) no shares were admitted to trading on a relevant market or on any other market outside the United Kingdom`

