        IF `the last statement delivered to the registrar under this section applies equally to the confirmation period concerned` THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply if and to the extent that the last statement delivered to the registrar under this section applies equally to the confirmation period concerned." (the whole of the statement is taken as applying equally or not: fork register)
        IF `s 853E(1) this section applies` EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the section applies is not known

@ref s 853E(2) Duty to notify trading status of shares (src:11492-11493)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Action of a party`
