-- src:11513 | (5) The information is—
-- src:11514 | (a) the name (as it appears in the company's register of members) of every person who was at any time during the confirmation period a member of the company,
-- src:11515 | (b) the number of shares of each class held at the end of the confirmation date concerned by each person who was a member of the company at that time,
-- src:11516 | (c) the number of shares of each class transferred during the confirmation period concerned by or to each person who was a member of the company at any time during that period, and
-- src:11517 | (d) the dates of registration of those transfers.
@ref s 853F(5) Duty to deliver shareholder information: non-traded companies (src:11513-11517)
GIVEN `the information gives the name (as it appears in the company's register of members) of every person who was at any time during the confirmation period a member of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information gives the number of shares of each class held at the end of the confirmation date concerned by each person who was a member of the company at that time` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information gives the number of shares of each class transferred during the confirmation period concerned by or to each person who was a member of the company at any time during that period` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information gives the dates of registration of those transfers` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 853F(5) the information delivered is the information the subsection requires` MEANS
    IF     `the information gives the name (as it appears in the company's register of members) of every person who was at any time during the confirmation period a member of the company`
       AND `the information gives the number of shares of each class held at the end of the confirmation date concerned by each person who was a member of the company at that time`
       AND `the information gives the number of shares of each class transferred during the confirmation period concerned by or to each person who was a member of the company at any time during that period`
       AND `the information gives the dates of registration of those transfers`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The information is— (a) the name ... of every person who was at any time during the confirmation period a member of the company, (b) the number of shares of each class held at the end of the confirmation date ..., (c) the number of shares of each class transferred during the confirmation period ..., and (d) the dates of registration of those transfers." (a closed list: "The information is")

