§§ `s 853G Duty to deliver shareholder information: certain traded companies`

-- src:11521 | (2) A “traded company” is a company any of whose shares were, at any time during the confirmation period concerned, shares admitted to trading on a relevant market or on any other market which is outside the United Kingdom.
