      `throughout the confirmation period concerned there were shares of the company which were shares admitted to trading on a relevant market` IS A BOOLEAN
      `throughout the confirmation period concerned the company was a DTR5 issuer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
