DECLARE `s 853H(2A) description of company` IS ONE OF
    `s 853H(2A)(a) a description specified in section 790B(1)(a)`
    `s 853H(2A)(b) a description specified in regulations under section 790B(1)(b)`

@ref s 853H(2A) Duty to deliver information about exemption from Part 21A (src:11533-11535)
GIVEN description IS A `s 853H(2A) description of company`
      `the statement specifies whether the company falls within the description specified in section 790B(1)(a) or a description specified in regulations under section 790B(1)(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the statement specifies what that description is` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 853H(2A) the statement under subsection (2) specifies what the subsection requires` MEANS
