    `s 853L how convicted` IS A `Mode of conviction`
    `s 853L fine not exceeding` IS A MAYBE `Fine limit`
    `s 853L daily default fine for continued contravention not exceeding` IS A MAYBE `s 853L(2) daily default fine limit`

-- (1): the failure. Counted in calendar days: the deadline is the fourteenth day after the last day of the review period.
-- src:11566 | (1) If a company fails to deliver a confirmation statement before the end of the period of 14 days after the end of a review period an offence is committed by—
-- src:11567 | (a) the company, and
-- src:11568 | (b) every officer of the company who is in default.
-- src:11569 | For this purpose a shadow director is treated as a director.
@ref s 853L(1) Failure to deliver confirmation statement (src:11566-11569)
GIVEN `the last day of the review period` IS A DATE
      `the date on which the confirmation statement was delivered, if it has been` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the date on which the question is asked` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 853L(1) the company has failed to deliver a confirmation statement before the end of the period of 14 days after the end of the review period` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the date on which the confirmation statement was delivered, if it has been`
    WHEN JUST delivered THEN
        IF Day delivered AT MOST (Day `the last day of the review period` PLUS 14)
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If a company fails to deliver a confirmation statement before the end of the period of 14 days after the end of a review period": it delivered in time
        ELSE JUST TRUE
    WHEN NOTHING THEN
        IF Day `the date on which the question is asked` GREATER THAN (Day `the last day of the review period` PLUS 14)
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If a company fails to deliver a confirmation statement before the end of the period of 14 days after the end of a review period": the period has not yet ended

@ref s 853L(1)(a) Failure to deliver confirmation statement (src:11566-11567)
GIVEN `s 853L(1) the company has failed to deliver a confirmation statement before the end of the period of 14 days after the end of the review period` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 853L(1)(a) the company commits an offence` MEANS
    `s 853L(1) the company has failed to deliver a confirmation statement before the end of the period of 14 days after the end of the review period` -- JUST TRUE: the offence is committed; JUST FALSE: "If a company fails ..." is not met; NOTHING stays NOTHING

@ref s 853L(1)(b) Failure to deliver confirmation statement (src:11568-11569)
GIVEN `s 853L(1) the company has failed to deliver a confirmation statement before the end of the period of 14 days after the end of the review period` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 1121 the officer is in default` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 853L(1)(b) the officer of the company commits an offence` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 853L(1) the company has failed to deliver a confirmation statement before the end of the period of 14 days after the end of the review period`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN `s 1121 the officer is in default` -- JUST FALSE here is the text's "who is in default"; NOTHING stays NOTHING (points outside the text, s 1121)
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If a company fails to deliver a confirmation statement before the end of the period of 14 days ..., an offence is committed by— ... (b) every officer of the company who is in default."
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): whether the company has failed is not known

@ref s 853L(1) Failure to deliver confirmation statement (src:11569-11569)
GIVEN `the person is a director` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 251 the person is a shadow director` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
