GIVEN how IS A `Mode of conviction`
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 853L(2) daily default fine limit`
`s 853L(6) the fine for each day on which the contravention continues and the person is in default does not exceed` MEANS
    CONSIDER how
    WHEN `on summary conviction in England and Wales` THEN JUST (`s 853L(2)(a) the greater of an amount in pounds and a fraction of a level on the standard scale` 500 4 0.1)
    WHEN `on summary conviction in Scotland` THEN JUST (`s 853L(2)(b) a fraction of a level on the standard scale` 5 0.1)
    WHEN `on summary conviction in Northern Ireland` THEN JUST (`s 853L(2)(b) a fraction of a level on the standard scale` 5 0.1)
    OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "(6) A person guilty of an offence under subsection (5) is liable on summary conviction— (a) in England and Wales ... (b) in Scotland or Northern Ireland": summary conviction is divided by place

-- The daily default fine limit as an amount: the pounds that the level named in the limit stands for are not in the Act (an input).
-- src:11570 | (2) A person guilty of an offence under subsection (1) is liable on summary conviction—
-- src:11571 | (a) in England and Wales to a fine, and, for continued contravention, a daily default fine not exceeding the greater of £500 and one-tenth of level 4 on the standard scale;
-- src:11572 | (b) in Scotland or Northern Ireland, to a fine not exceeding level 5 on the standard scale and, for continued contravention, a daily default fine not exceeding one-tenth of level 5 on the standard scale.
@ref s 853L(2) Failure to deliver confirmation statement (src:11570-11572)
GIVEN limit IS A `s 853L(2) daily default fine limit`
      `the pounds that the level on the standard scale named in the limit stands for` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 853L(2) the daily default fine limit in pounds` MEANS
    CONSIDER limit
    WHEN `s 853L(2)(a) the greater of an amount in pounds and a fraction of a level on the standard scale` pounds level fraction THEN
        IF pounds AT LEAST (fraction TIMES `the pounds that the level on the standard scale named in the limit stands for`)
        THEN pounds
        ELSE fraction TIMES `the pounds that the level on the standard scale named in the limit stands for`
    WHEN `s 853L(2)(b) a fraction of a level on the standard scale` level fraction THEN fraction TIMES `the pounds that the level on the standard scale named in the limit stands for`

